00:42:56.182 --> 00:42:59.830
♪Fogo forjado nos céus
queima carne e osso♪

00:43:00.342 --> 00:43:04.374
♪Desenterre a verdade enterrada
sob a terra♪

00:43:04.566 --> 00:43:09.142
